## Development

```bash
make test       # run tests
make lint       # ruff lint
make typecheck  # mypy type check
```

Add a new module:

```bash
merapy add-module <name>
{% if use_sql %}make migration-create name=add_<name>
make migration
{% endif %}```

Add a delivery handler to an existing module:

```bash
merapy add-handler <module> <type>
# types: rest, grpc, graphql, kafka, cron, redis, rabbitmq, postgres, task_queue
```
